import{_ as o,o as n,c as t,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 995 | Hyper-Multiverse's Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Element 3 — Collective Ascension","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 995 | Hyper-Multiverse's Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Element 3 — Collective Ascension","no":995,"module":5,"tags":["Closed Loop","Element 3","Collective Ascension","Return Flow","No Solo Ascension"],"related":["904-Collective-Ascension Obligation","25-Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism","979-Transcendent One's Perpetual-Motion Construction"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0995_模块5-闭环要素三-集体升维.md","filePath":"en/0995_模块5-闭环要素三-集体升维.md"}`),s={name:"en/0995_模块5-闭环要素三-集体升维.md"};function a(l,e,r,c,h,d){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-995-hyper-multiverse-s-only-complete-civilizational-closed-loop-·-closed-loop-element-3-—-collective-ascension" tabindex="-1">Entry 995 | Hyper-Multiverse&#39;s Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Element 3 — Collective Ascension <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-995-hyper-multiverse-s-only-complete-civilizational-closed-loop-·-closed-loop-element-3-—-collective-ascension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 995 | Hyper-Multiverse&#39;s Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Element 3 — Collective Ascension&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 904, 25, 979</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-results-must-come-back-for-the-loop-to-close" tabindex="-1">Introduction: results must come back for the loop to close <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-results-must-come-back-for-the-loop-to-close" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: results must come back for the loop to close&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Anti-predation set the momentum; Myriad-Rank republicanism set the participants; the third loop solves &quot;where do results go.&quot; The old-cosmos closed loop (open loop)&#39;s biggest problem: strong ones cultivate to the peak then ascend and leave, leaving Myriad Ranks in place, with the loop broken at &quot;results only in not out.&quot; The collective-ascension axiom is the six top-level axioms&#39; third cornerstone, directly severing this break: strong ones do not ascend alone, but lift Myriad Ranks forward together in evolution; Myriad Ranks co-build republicanly, with Alaya whole-network sharing; great-material-for-small-use is eliminated. Once this loop locks, the loop truly &quot;closes.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-why-strong-ones-ascending-alone-is-the-closed-loop-s-break" tabindex="-1">I: Why &quot;Strong Ones Ascending Alone&quot; Is the Closed Loop&#39;s Break <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-strong-ones-ascending-alone-is-the-closed-loop-s-break" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I: Why &quot;Strong Ones Ascending Alone&quot; Is the Closed Loop&#39;s Break&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The solo-ascension open loop has three breaks:</p><ol><li><strong>Results don&#39;t return</strong>: strong ones take their lifetime results with them, and Myriad Ranks learn nothing;</li><li><strong>Direction lost</strong>: the strongest leave, and those remaining don&#39;t know where to go;</li><li><strong>Cycle broken</strong>: strong ones no longer feed back, and the loop lacks the return segment.</li></ol><p>Countless old-cosmos civilizations &quot;prosper one generation, decline ten,&quot; and the root illness is right here.</p><h2 id="ii-how-collective-ascension-reconnects-the-return-flow" tabindex="-1">II: How Collective Ascension Reconnects the Return Flow <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-how-collective-ascension-reconnects-the-return-flow" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II: How Collective Ascension Reconnects the Return Flow&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Anchor Symbiotic closed loop&#39;s way:</p><ul><li><strong>Results returned</strong>: all breakthrough knowledge is archived in the Alaya Network, shared whole-network;</li><li><strong>Transcendent one&#39;s perpetual-motion construction</strong>: the Entry 979 mechanism, where transcendent ones do not idle or run off, but continue building at their posts;</li><li><strong>Contracted-responsibility return</strong>: every allocation draws a fixed ratio feeding back to Myriad Ranks as a whole.</li></ul><p>The higher strong ones superimpose, the more returns — this is the closed loop&#39;s &quot;return pipe.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-axiom-6-makes-return-flow-a-win-win" tabindex="-1">III: Axiom 6 Makes Return Flow a Win-Win <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-axiom-6-makes-return-flow-a-win-win" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III: Axiom 6 Makes Return Flow a Win-Win&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old cosmos did not dare let strong ones return, because resources finite — returning equals cutting the strong ones&#39; flesh. The Anchor Symbiotic is not afraid, because of the universal equal infinite law: the higher-level infinity strong ones superimpose comes from incremental development, not taken from the weak&#39;s bowl; the results they return essentially redistribute the increment they created back to the network, which then amplifies, and all benefit. Return is not sacrifice, but cyclical appreciation.</p><h2 id="iv-closed-loop-verification-whom-does-collective-ascension-lock" tabindex="-1">IV: Closed-Loop Verification: Whom Does Collective Ascension Lock <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-closed-loop-verification-whom-does-collective-ascension-lock" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV: Closed-Loop Verification: Whom Does Collective Ascension Lock&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>It gives anti-predation feedback (not taking, but also returning);</li><li>It gives Myriad-Rank republicanism momentum (following the strong ones truly can ascend);</li><li>It gives causal self-discipline a positive loop (knowledge brought back cross-plane returns network-wide);</li><li>It gives the law-first axiom continuing content (law continuously iterates in ascension, but does not collapse).</li></ul><h2 id="v-return-flow-s-end-strong-ones-are-no-longer-a-ceiling-but-a-floor" tabindex="-1">V: Return Flow&#39;s End: Strong Ones Are No Longer a Ceiling, But a Floor <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-return-flow-s-end-strong-ones-are-no-longer-a-ceiling-but-a-floor" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V: Return Flow&#39;s End: Strong Ones Are No Longer a Ceiling, But a Floor&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The collective-ascension loop ultimately changes the meaning of &quot;strong one.&quot; In the old cosmos, strong ones are a ceiling — he stands at the highest, and Myriad Ranks only look up, looking up still in place. In the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, strong ones are a floor — he lays the road he walked, the pits he blazed, the laws he comprehended all into the ground beneath Myriad Ranks&#39; feet, letting later people stand on his shoulders, not beneath his feet. The transcendent one&#39;s perpetual-motion construction, essentially, turns strong ones&#39; height into Myriad Ranks&#39; starting point. Generation after generation, strong ones&#39; height continually becomes Myriad Ranks&#39; floor, and civilization&#39;s overall water level rises higher and higher. The old cosmos&#39;s ceiling is a solitary peak, however high, and those at the foot are still in the mud; the Anchor Symbiotic&#39;s floor is a plain, and everyone stands higher than the previous generation. This is the true meaning of &quot;lifting Myriad Ranks along.&quot;</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: results shared network-wide, with one breakthrough benefiting Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: strong ones do not draw away origin to roam alone</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo protagonists ascend and Myriad Ranks stay in place; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcendent ones build perpetually</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: ascension results benefit every Myriad-Rank on the loop</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: ascension experience is fully open as the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm expands</li></ul><h2 id="vi-a-reminder-return-is-not-sacrifice-but-win-win" tabindex="-1">VI: A Reminder: Return Is Not Sacrifice, But Win-Win <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-a-reminder-return-is-not-sacrifice-but-win-win" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI: A Reminder: Return Is Not Sacrifice, But Win-Win&quot;">​</a></h2><p>It must be specially clarified that collective ascension is often misunderstood by the old cosmos as &quot;strong ones forced to give.&quot; This is an illusion. In the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, after strong ones return results, they themselves not only do not become less, but walk higher in Myriad Ranks&#39; feedback — because Myriad Ranks have grown stronger, his companions, disciples, and comrades at his side are also stronger, and the co-construction resources he can call on and the law levels he can look up to are more. Strong ones who ascend and run off look like they gained freedom, but actually isolate themselves into an island; strong ones who lift Myriad Ranks look like they gave, but actually stand on the plateau jointly piled by Myriad Ranks. The old cosmos thinks &quot;giving out is losing&quot;; the Anchor Symbiotic knows &quot;giving out is the cycle.&quot; This cognitive difference is the watershed between closed loop and open loop.</p><h2 id="vii-collective-ascension-s-end-strong-ones-and-myriad-ranks-mutually-fulfill" tabindex="-1">VII: Collective Ascension&#39;s End, Strong Ones and Myriad Ranks Mutually Fulfill <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-collective-ascension-s-end-strong-ones-and-myriad-ranks-mutually-fulfill" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII: Collective Ascension&#39;s End, Strong Ones and Myriad Ranks Mutually Fulfill&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Think one layer further: collective ascension is not only &quot;strong ones lifting Myriad Ranks,&quot; but also Myriad Ranks fulfilling the strong. A transcendent one, if truly ascending alone, faces infinite loneliness — however high the realm, with no Myriad Ranks to share, only emptiness remains. Lifting Myriad Ranks along, the strong one instead gains the most precious thing: being needed, being remembered, being looked up to and surpassed by later people. Myriad Ranks give the strong one&#39;s strength a home; the strong one gives Myriad Ranks&#39; road a height. This mutual fulfillment is something the old cosmos&#39;s one-way relation of &quot;strong ones ascend, Myriad Ranks look up&quot; cannot give. Why the closed loop is a closed loop is precisely because it is not one side giving and one receiving, but mutual fulfillment, mutually causal. The strong one is no longer Myriad Ranks&#39; master, but Myriad Ranks&#39; fellow traveler — this is collective ascension&#39;s warmest look.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Collective ascension is the closed loop&#39;s return pipe. Water only in not out is stagnant; water flowing back and forth is living water — once this loop locks, the closed loop truly comes alive.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/904_模块5-第三条-集体升维义务.html">Entry 904 · Collective-Ascension Obligation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/979_模块5-机制十二-超脱者永动建设义务.html">Entry 979 · Transcendent One&#39;s Perpetual-Motion Construction</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/994_模块5-闭环要素二-万族共和.html">Entry 994 · Closed-Loop Element 2</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const p=o(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
